      "statement": "The npm scripts are dev/start (astro dev), build (astro build to ./build), typecheck (tsc --noEmit — added in PR #130 as the one-command typecheck gate, since the lockfile previously pinned typescript 5.6.3 while package.json declared ^5.9.3, breaking clean installs with 11× TS2315 'Uint8Array is not generic'), test (node --no-warnings --test \\\"tests/*.test.mjs\\\" — the Node built-in runner over ALL forty-nine tests/*.test.mjs regression-guard files in one invocation; the test-case count inside them is 59), lint (prettier --check . && eslint .), format (prettier --write .), and protogen (protoc + ts-proto regenerating src/proto/message.ts). The Zero Factory precommit hook's default/all path runs format (npx prettier --write . + npx eslint . --fix), then build (npx tsc --noEmit + npm run build), then test (npm test — all 49 regression-guard files).",
